# Soma Changelog

Whenever you change the Soma Design System Figma file (`hB1NzwMnZt2ALeR0OslaWi`), finish by appending to the Changelog page at node `1016:14943`.

https://www.figma.com/design/hB1NzwMnZt2ALeR0OslaWi/Soma-Design-System?node-id=1016-14943

This is part of finishing the task, not optional cleanup.

## Entry format (required)

Each bullet is **one scannable line**: bold component name, em dash, short outcome.

```
Component — What changed, in one clause.
```

- Label: Figtree **SemiBold** 14 / 18 (component or token family only)
- Rest: Figtree Regular 14 / 18
- Marker: a separate `•` text node, not a typed prefix inside the body
- Row: horizontal auto-layout — `•` (hug) + 8px gap + body (fill). Wrapped lines must hang past the bullet and align with the first line of text
- Sort A–Z by component name within Changed / Fixed / Added
- Merge related notes for the same component into one line; do not split one change across four bullets
- No implementation asides: no pixel math, no “was X”, no parentheticals, no token dumps

```
❌ Pagination page selector is 24px; prev/next containers are radius.full circles.
❌ Pagination prev/next use the Select chevron.down glyph (12px), rotated 90°.
✅ Pagination — 24px selector, circular prev/next, Select chevron, 12px value–chevron gap.
```

## Page structure

- Date group = **today**, most recent first — never invent semver
- Badge: Soft, smallest size — Added = success, Changed = brand, Fixed = warning
- Reuse an existing category block for that date; do not duplicate badges
- If a later change supersedes an older bullet, update the stale line instead of adding a second one
